# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# Replaces device/google/trout/trout_arm64/wifi/virtwifi.rc: the product makefile lists
# this copy before the trout inherit, and for one destination the first PRODUCT_COPY_FILES
# entry wins. trout's trout-virtwifi-setup ran `cmd wifi set-wifi-enabled enabled` at
# every boot, which also saves Wi-Fi ON, so the Settings toggle could neither start off
# nor stay off across a reboot. Nothing is defined here: Wi-Fi starts as the user left
# it, and off on a fresh /data (def_wifi_on=false).
